                                        <div class="ielts-reading-question-section-content">
                                            <div class="ielts-reading-section-content-wrapper"><p>Complete the summary below.</p>
<p>Choose ONE WORD ONLY from the passage for each answer.</p>
<p><strong>Archaeological discoveries</strong></p>
<p>The Mapungubwe community''s <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">22</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="22" name="question_22" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[22] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> is indicated by the amount of professionally made pottery discovered at the site. Many of these objects, such as beakers and bowls, are highly decorated and have been marked with stamps. Other finds include round ceramic objects, <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">23</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="23" name="question_23" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[23] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> and figures of various animals, as well as models of people with stretched <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">24</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="24" name="question_24" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[24] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> . It is possible that these had a role in ceremonies to honour <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">25</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="25" name="question_25" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[25] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> . In addition, pieces of <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">26</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="26" name="question_26" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[26] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> made from a local metal have been found at the site.</p>
</div>                                        </div>
                                        <div class="ielts-reading-questions">
                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="ielts-reading-question-item">
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="ielts-reading-question-item">
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="ielts-reading-question-item">
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="ielts-reading-question-item">
                                                                                                    
