                                                                                                                                                            <h2 class="ielts-reading-question-section-heading">
                                            Questions 36-39                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                    </h2>
                                        <div class="ielts-reading-question-section-content">
                                            <p>Do the following statements agree with the claims of the writer in Reading Passage 3?</p>
<p>In boxes 36-39 on your answer sheet, write</p>
