<p>- loss of access to the <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">6</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="6" name="question_6" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[6] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> which they use for migration</li>
